---
// The instruction for «Ubicar en el mapa». Picking closes the sheet so the map is
// free to tap, which takes the form —button label and geo note included— off the
// screen: without this bar the sheet just seems to have closed. Lives in the
// header, like `AlertBanner`, so it does not fight the floating pills for the
// bottom corner. Only mobile: on desktop the sheet never closes and the form's
// own note is right there. Starts hidden; `features/location-picker.ts` turns it
// on while pick mode is armed.
---

<div
  id="pick-hint"
  role="status"
  hidden
  class="mt-2 flex items-center gap-3 rounded-xl border border-amber-300 bg-amber-50 px-3 py-2 text-amber-900 lg:hidden"
>
  <svg
    class="h-5 w-5 shrink-0 text-amber-700"
    viewBox="0 0 24 24"
    fill="none"
    stroke="currentColor"
    stroke-width="2"
    stroke-linecap="round"
    stroke-linejoin="round"
    aria-hidden="true"
  >
    <circle cx="12" cy="10" r="2.5"></circle>
    <path d="M12 21.5c4.5-5 7-8.3 7-11.5a7 7 0 1 0-14 0c0 3.2 2.5 6.5 7 11.5z"></path>
  </svg>

  <p class="flex-1 text-xs leading-snug">
    <span class="block font-semibold">Toca el mapa sobre el edificio</span>
    <span class="block text-amber-800">Luego puedes arrastrar el punto para afinarlo.</span>
  </p>

  <button
    type="button"
    id="pick-hint-cancel"
    class="shrink-0 rounded-md border border-amber-300 bg-white px-2.5 py-1.5 text-xs font-semibold text-amber-900 transition hover:bg-amber-100"
  >
    Cancelar
  </button>
</div>
